<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO $1 billion Eurobond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO $1 billion Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Thursday that it had assigned an AA+ rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's (TEPCO) $1 billion 7.0 percent Eurobond due February 13, 2007.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
